# Products setting page

Route: `src/app/(app)/products/[id]/page.tsx` (`/products/[id]`).

Opened from the merchandise Fit List via the **Settings** link (not from Charges & freight).

This is the per-product settings screen: line price, size×drop subset, size upcharges. It is not the Products Fit List (`/products`) and not Inventory.

When the user says **products setting page**, change this route—not the list.
